### Iniciar la Booking Saga (reserva de asiento -> fraude -> pago async -> emisión)
# Responde 202 Accepted: el pago se procesa de forma asíncrona vía RabbitMQ.
POST {{baseUrl}}/ordering/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "order-123",
  "eventId": "event-789",
  "amount": 100,
  "seatNumbers": ["A1"]
}

### Listar tickets
GET {{baseUrl}}/ordering/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
